WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.037 --> 00:00:16.468
The Tang Monk trembled with fear.

2
00:00:17.289 --> 00:00:19.050
The animals showed their fangs.

3
00:00:19.070 --> 00:00:22.053
“Master!” cried Wukong.

4
00:00:23.134 --> 00:00:24.535
The monkey was running fast.

5
00:00:25.736 --> 00:00:29.760
He swung his iron bar, and the animals ran back into the forest.

6
00:00:32.448 --> 00:00:33.409
Wukong smiled.

7
00:00:33.429 --> 00:00:36.351
“Sorry for making the horse run, Master.

8
00:00:37.572 --> 00:00:38.873
I thought it would be funny.”

9
00:00:40.434 --> 00:00:41.775
The Tang Monk frowned.

10
00:00:41.795 --> 00:00:43.996
“It wasn’t funny at all!

11
00:00:44.837 --> 00:00:46.478
Those beasts were going to attack me!”

12
00:00:47.639 --> 00:00:49.560
“Nonsense,” said Wukong.

13
00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:52.242
“You never have to fear any wild animals.

14
00:00:53.023 --> 00:00:55.224
You have three powerful companions.”

15
00:00:56.505 --> 00:00:59.307
Bajie and Wujing soon caught up to them.

16
00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:03.341
They all continued along the road.

17
00:01:04.502 --> 00:01:07.284
The Tang Monk pointed to a building up ahead.

18
00:01:07.304 --> 00:01:09.846
“That looks like a Daoist abbey.”

19
00:01:10.987 --> 00:01:14.770
“I’m sure the abbey’s priests will let us rest for a while,” said Wujing.

20
00:01:16.891 --> 00:01:20.154
When they reached the abbey, Bajie knocked on the door.

21
00:01:22.095 --> 00:01:23.516
Two priests opened it.

22
00:01:23.536 --> 00:01:26.858
“I’m here with the Tang Monk,” said the pig.

23
00:01:26.878 --> 00:01:28.640
“May we come in?”

24
00:01:29.748 --> 00:01:31.809
The priests looked at the Tang Monk.

25
00:01:32.869 --> 00:01:35.230
“Our master told us about you,” said one of them.

26
00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:38.412
“He said you would travel past our abbey someday.

27
00:01:38.592 --> 00:01:39.292
Please, come in.”

28
00:01:39.312 --> 00:01:42.313
“Who is your master?”

29
00:01:42.653 --> 00:01:43.574
asked the Tang Monk.

30
00:01:44.434 --> 00:01:45.675
“How did he know about me?”

31
00:01:46.735 --> 00:01:49.776
“Our master is the Great Immortal,” said the first priest.

32
00:01:49.796 --> 00:01:53.958
“He is very wise and powerful.”

33
00:01:54.558 --> 00:01:55.539
Wukong laughed.

34
00:01:55.959 --> 00:01:56.839
“I’ve never heard of him.

35
00:01:57.519 --> 00:01:58.960
I doubt he’s very powerful.”

36
00:02:00.192 --> 00:02:01.633
The Tang Monk scowled.

37
00:02:01.653 --> 00:02:05.756
“Show some respect, Wukong,” he whispered.

38
00:02:06.997 --> 00:02:08.658
The priests looked annoyed.

39
00:02:08.678 --> 00:02:12.301
“Our master is visiting friends in Heaven right now.

40
00:02:13.401 --> 00:02:16.524
If he wasn’t powerful, he wouldn’t be able to do that.”

41
00:02:17.704 --> 00:02:18.685
Wukong shrugged.

42
00:02:18.705 --> 00:02:21.387
“I used to live in Heaven.

43
00:02:22.108 --> 00:02:23.929
The place isn’t that great.”

44
00:02:23.949 --> 00:02:28.092
“Wukong,” said the Tang Monk.

45
00:02:29.104 --> 00:02:31.265
“Please go outside and tend the horse.”

46
00:02:34.266 --> 00:02:35.926
Wukong went back outside.

47
00:02:37.867 --> 00:02:40.187
Wujing went out to get the bags.

48
00:02:42.808 --> 00:02:43.929
“May I use the kitchen?”

49
00:02:44.349 --> 00:02:45.169
asked Bajie.

50
00:02:45.189 --> 00:02:47.890
“I want to cook some food for the Tang Monk.”

51
00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:51.711
“It’s through that door,” said one priest.

52
00:02:52.431 --> 00:02:54.872
He pointed to a door in the back of the room.

53
00:02:55.960 --> 00:02:59.702
Bajie went into the kitchen while the Tang Monk talked to the priests.

54
00:02:59.722 --> 00:03:03.924
“There’s a ginseng tree behind the abbey,” said one priest.

55
00:03:03.944 --> 00:03:07.786
“Its fruit takes ten thousand years to become ripe.

56
00:03:08.666 --> 00:03:12.288
According to legend, one bite of the fruit will make you live forever.

57
00:03:13.308 --> 00:03:14.009
Would you like one?”

58
00:03:14.029 --> 00:03:18.151
“A fruit like that is a true treasure,” said the Tang Monk.

59
00:03:18.171 --> 00:03:20.892
“Will your master be upset if I eat it?”

60
00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:25.322
“Our master said we could give you one,” said the other priest.

61
00:03:25.342 --> 00:03:27.704
“We’ll go and cut one down.”

62
00:03:28.965 --> 00:03:30.866
The two priests went outside.

63
00:03:33.168 --> 00:03:35.750
A moment later they came back in with a tray.

64
00:03:39.612 --> 00:03:41.073
The Tang Monk screamed.

65
00:03:42.054 --> 00:03:44.916
On the tray lay a tiny sleeping baby.

66
00:03:44.936 --> 00:03:47.838
“I can’t eat that,” cried the monk.

67
00:03:47.858 --> 00:03:49.860
“It—it’s a baby!”

68
00:03:51.228 --> 00:03:53.590
“It’s not a baby,” said one priest.

69
00:03:53.610 --> 00:03:55.352
“It’s a ginseng fruit.

70
00:03:56.352 --> 00:03:58.935
It only looks like a baby to you because you’re a mortal.”

71
00:03:58.955 --> 00:04:02.518
“Please take it away!”

72
00:04:02.758 --> 00:04:03.699
cried the Tang Monk.

73
00:04:04.759 --> 00:04:08.403
The priests tried to convince him that the fruit wasn’t a baby.

74
00:04:09.684 --> 00:04:11.365
But the monk just shook his head.

75
00:04:15.268 --> 00:04:19.432
The priests took the ginseng fruit out of the room and into a hallway.

76
00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:22.882
“We shouldn’t waste this fruit,” said one priest.

77
00:04:22.902 --> 00:04:24.963
“No,” said the other.

78
00:04:24.983 --> 00:04:27.164
“It is too delicious and valuable.

79
00:04:27.725 --> 00:04:28.825
Let’s eat it ourselves.”

80
00:04:29.806 --> 00:04:32.147
The two priests shared the ginseng fruit.

81
00:04:33.148 --> 00:04:34.989
Bajie was in the kitchen nearby.

82
00:04:35.989 --> 00:04:37.811
He had heard everything they’d said.

83
00:04:38.431 --> 00:04:39.592
His stomach growled.

84
00:04:40.632 --> 00:04:44.375
“That fruit sounds wonderful,” said Bajie to himself.

85
00:04:44.395 --> 00:04:46.296
“I want some too!”
